    {
      "section": "dsh-office",
      "text": "Remote skill provider for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness):\ninstall skills from a JSON catalog through the standard `ctx.skills` registry —\nno manual folder copying.\n\n本插件**只提供办公效率线（2 个技能）**：\n\n| 技能 | 用途 | 披露 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `excel2insights` | 本地 Excel 数据分析（纯本地，数据不出机器） | cloud:false |\n| `sum2slides-pro` | 对话/会议纪要 → 专业 PPT | cloud:false |"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-office",
      "text": "合规、插件工具等其他技能线**不属于本插件**（详见 [wwumit 技能生态](https://github.com/wwumit/skills-catalog)）。\n默认目录为线级 `catalog-office.json`，主目录 `catalog.json` 仍为全量登记层（开放数据层），保持不变。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\nnpm install @wwumit/dsh-office"
    },
    {
      "section": "peer deps: @deepseek-ai/cordis, @deepseek-ai/dsh-skill",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage (composition)",
      "text": "```ts\nimport { Context } from '@deepseek-ai/cordis'\nimport * as office from '@wwumit/dsh-office'\n\nexport function apply(ctx: Context) {"
